    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "HWP Estate Agents are delighted to bring this spacious two-bedroom apartment to the market. This first-floor apartment is situated in the heart of Castlemill Shopping development with a vast array of amenities, including Dunnes Stores as its anchor tenant. With sandy beaches and the harbour a short stroll away, this apartment is ideal for those evening walks or sunny days at the beach.\nThe apartment is flooded with natural daylight and has a large balcony for you to sit out and relax for those morning coffees. With a large entrance hall leading into your open living/dining space and out onto the balcony, along with a fitted kitchen, it is an open canvas for you to make it your dream home. There are two double bedrooms with one master ensuite. \nThe property is ideally situated close to Balbriggan Town Centre with a wide range of amenities at hand, along with a good public transport infrastructure, including Dublin Bus, Bus Eireann and Suburban Rail access to Dublin City Centre. There are several schools and child care facilities in the area ideal for that growing family. "
      },
